            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "pattern": "^(?:~\\/|\\/)"
          },
          "description": "Toolchain paths the worker may read (0008 section 2, 2026-10-12 amendment); engine steps read them too. .dipo/office.local.yaml may add machine-specific paths to this list (version 4)."
